    {
      "text": "speak peace to their neighbours, Ps. 28:3. Lord will bless his people with peace, Ps. 29:11. do good; seek peace, Ps. 34:14. perfect man … end of that man is peace, Ps. 37:37. He maketh wars to cease, Ps. 46:9. Great peace have they which love thy law, Ps. 119:165. Pray for the peace of Jerusalem, Ps. 122:6. he maketh even his enemies to be at peace, Prov. 16:7. time of war, and a time of peace, Eccl. 3:8. neither shall they learn war any more, Isa. 2:4 (Micah 4:3; 2 Ne. 12:4). everlasting Father, The Prince of Peace, Isa. 9:6 (2 Ne. 19:6). work of righteousness shall be peace, Isa. 32:17. There is no peace … unto the wicked, Isa. 48:22 (57:21; 1 Ne. 20:22). saying, Peace, peace; when there is no peace, Jer. 6:14 (8:11; Ezek. 13:10, 16). prophets … that bite with their teeth, and cry, Peace, Micah 3:5. in this place will I give peace, Hag. 2:9. he shall speak peace unto the heathen, Zech. 9:10.",
